# Smart Working Process

## Task execution process
1. Pre-preparation
   - Check tool library
   - Select tools to apply
   - Preparing environment
   - Development of an implementation plan

2. Implementation process
   - Use of existing tools
   - Record new demand points
   - interim script development
   - Problem solution

3. Late Summary
   - Tool Usage Effect
   - New tool requirements
   - Suggestions for improvement
   - Summary of experience

## Tools development time
1. Develop Now
   - HF duplicates
   - Standardized processes
   - Nowhere of value
   - Development of sex workers

2. Planned development
   - Medium frequency tasks
   - More complex processes
   - Need for teamwork
   - Large input

3. Observation assessment
   - Low frequency tasks
   - Undefined needs
   - Frequently changed
   - Unclear proceeds

### Efficiency Promotion Policy
